(answered is that man is so ignorant of the unseen of Allah hidden from him\054 even in his own life\073) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(it is a real ignorance confirming the reality of the creature\047s value of nothingness before the) Tj
T*
(decrees of Allah the Exalted\054 such that he may not even be able to calculate precisely how) Tj
T*
(much of his supplication was answered\056 And in view of all this\054 as a humble servant of Allah the) Tj
T*
(Exalted\054 in need of Him\054 I continue to make most of the same supplications since that very) Tj
T*
(dream \0502016 \055 2026\051\054 over which a little less than ten years have now passed\056 For it is never) Tj
T*
(fitting for us to cut off supplication\054 and it is never right to cut off seeking means to the Mighty) Tj
T*
(Lord even if we were given glad tidings that our supplications were answered\056 For the) Tj
T*
-0.094416 Tw
(answering is one matter\054 and continuing the supplication is another\056 However long the answer of) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(the supplication is delayed\054 call upon Allah the Exalted\054 and do not stop even if you are given) Tj
T*
(glad tidings that your supplication has been answered\056 Do not hasten\054 do not resent\054 do not) Tj
T*
(grumble\054 do not be displeased\054 and do not despair so that you stop supplicating and abandon) Tj
T*
(the great worship of supplication\054 and become one of the regretful\056) Tj
